    "details": "<h2 class=\"blue_un-border-before hdng mock-title\">All that you need to know about MEDHA 2026</h2>\n<div class=\"position-relative\">\n<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live expanded\">\n<p><strong>Focus Area:</strong></p>\n<p>This is an AI-focused, software-only hackathon. All solutions must be software-based and must incorporate Artificial Intelligence or Machine Learning at their core.<br />Possible domains include (but are not limited to):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Natural Language Processing &amp; Generative AI</li>\n<li>Computer Vision &amp; Image Recognition</li>\n<li>Predictive Analytics &amp; Data Intelligence</li>\n<li>AI for Healthcare &amp; Assistive Tech</li>\n<li>AI for Sustainability &amp; Smart Systems</li>\n<li>AI in Cybersecurity</li>\n<li>Autonomous Systems &amp; Decision Making</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Problem Statements:</strong><br />Problem statements will not be released at the time of registration. They will be made available to all participants after the closing of registrations.&nbsp; Teams should prepare their AI/software foundations before the reveal.</p>\n<p><strong>Important Notes &amp; Policies:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>No travel or accommodation will be provided. Participants must manage their own arrangements.</li>\n<li>Shortlisted teams must be physically present for the final offline round.</li>\n<li>Team changes are not allowed without prior approval.</li>\n<li>Participants must maintain professional conduct. Misconduct may lead to disqualification.</li>\n<li>Decisions of judges and organizers will be final and binding.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"floater\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
